ZKDVYN.svg" style=3D"color: transparent;"></div></figure>
<p>One way to distinguish between them is to designate a representative for=
 each community. Let's assign person 0 as the representative of the left co=
mmunity, and person 2 as the representative of the right community. We can =
represent these communities as a graph, where each community is a connected=
 component, and each person in a community points to their representative:<=
/p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents two distinct directed acyclic graphs (DAGs)=
.  The left DAG, highlighted in light blue, is a simple linear graph with t=
