K55GO.svg" style=3D"color: transparent;"></div></figure>
<p>We first need to identify their representatives so we know which communi=
ties these two people belong to. We can use the <code>find</code> function =
for this, which will be discussed later:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a diagram illustrating a find operation wit=
hin a data structure, likely a disjoint-set data structure or similar.  The=
