ies/image-13-07-4-U3YJIFER.svg" style=3D"color: transparent;"></div></figur=
e>
<p>Before merging these communities, we need to pick one of the two current=
 representatives as the representative of the merged community. For now, le=
t=E2=80=99s just pick person 0.</p>
<p>From here, one strategy is to connect everyone in the second community d=
irectly to person 0:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a directed acyclic graph (DAG) illustrating=
