 them.</p>
<p><strong>Union by size</strong><br>
Recall that before merging two communities, we need to pick someone to repr=
esent the merged community. Our choice is between <code>rep_x</code> and <c=
ode>rep_y</code>. Is one a better choice than the other? Consider the follo=
wing two communities:</p>
